('A3bNDwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Machado de Assis","subtitle":"obras completas","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Viseu","publishedDate":"2020-03-01","description":"Joaquim Maria Machado de Assis (Rio de Janeiro, 21 de junho de 1839 — Rio de Janeiro, 29 de setembro de 1908) foi um escritor brasileiro, considerado por muitos críticos, estudiosos, escritores e leitores um dos maiores senão o maior nome da literatura do Brasil. Obras Romances Ressurreição, (1872) A mão e a luva, (1874) Helena, (1876) Iaiá Garcia, (1878) Memórias Póstumas de Brás Cubas, (1881) Casa Velha, (1885) Quincas Borba, (1891) Dom Casmurro, (1899) Esaú e Jacó, (1904) Memorial de Aires, (1908) Coletânea de contos Contos Fluminenses, (1870) Histórias da Meia-Noite, (1873) Papéis Avulsos, (1882) Histórias sem Data, (1884) Várias Histórias, (1896) Páginas Recolhidas, (1899) Relíquias da Casa Velha, (1906)","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9788530013837"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"8530013832"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":3965,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"2.11.9.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=A3bNDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=A3bNDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=A3bNDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=1&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=A3bNDwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=A3bNDwAAQBAJ"}'),
('nlu_EQAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Machado radical","subtitle":"A face provocadora de Machado de Assis em 33 contos de crítica social e poder","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Pop Stories","publishedDate":"2026-02-06","description":"Este volume reúne contos em que Machado de Assis desmonta as máscaras sociais e revela como poder, ambição e conveniência costumam falar mais alto que qualquer discurso moral. Os contos irônicos e cheios de tensão acompanham personagens que negociam valores, exploram brechas e se adaptam ao jogo para sobreviver ou se destacar. Em escolas, repartições, igrejas e salões, surgem disputas silenciosas, acordos velados e decisões que mostram até onde as pessoas estão dispostas a ir para conseguir o que querem. Um conjunto direto e incômodo, que expõe regras não escritas da vida social e convida o leitor a mergulhar em histórias onde ninguém sai ileso. Os seguintes contos podem ser lidos aqui: A anedota pecuniária; A carteira; A causa secreta; A herança; A ideia do Ezequiel Maia; A igreja do diabo; A sereníssima República; Como se inventaram os almanaques; Conto de escola; Conversão de um avaro; Decadência de dois grandes homens; Dona Jucunda; Evolução; Ex cathedra; Flor anônima; Galeria póstuma; Ideias de Canário; Identidade; João Fernandes; Jogo do bicho; Letra vencida; Marcha fúnebre; O caso da vara; O cônego ou metafísica do estilo; O contrato; O diplomático; O empréstimo; O escrivão Coimbra; O machete; O país das quimeras; Ponto de vista; Teoria do medalhão; Último capítulo.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9786554116480"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"6554116486"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":303,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.1.1.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=nlu_EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=nlu_EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=nlu_EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=2&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=nlu_EQAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=nlu_EQAAQBAJ"}'),
('0s-MEQAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Memórias Póstumas de Brás Cubas","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Digital World","publishedDate":"2025-10-06","description":"Publicada em 1881, Memórias Póstumas de Brás Cubas marca um divisor de águas na literatura brasileira. Nesta obra-prima, Machado de Assis inaugura o Realismo no Brasil e revoluciona a narrativa ao conceder a voz ao próprio morto. Brás Cubas, já falecido, escreve suas memórias sem remorso, censura ou convenção, observando o mundo dos vivos com o olhar irônico de quem não tem mais nada a perder. Através de capítulos curtos, incisivos e de humor sutil, o narrador nos conduz por uma viagem entre o sublime e o grotesco, o cômico e o trágico. A aparente leveza do texto esconde uma crítica profunda à sociedade do século XIX — às vaidades humanas, às falsas virtudes, ao moralismo e à hipocrisia das elites. Brás Cubas é, ao mesmo tempo, narrador e objeto de estudo, símbolo de uma geração que viveu sem propósito, buscando glória e prazer em meio ao vazio existencial. Com sua escrita inovadora e espirituosa, Machado de Assis rompe as barreiras do tempo e do espaço literário. O diálogo direto com o leitor, as digressões filosóficas e o jogo de ironias tornam o romance uma experiência única, moderna e profundamente psicológica. É uma obra que desafia rótulos e antecipa técnicas narrativas que influenciariam escritores em todo o mundo. Esta edição digital, totalmente revista e adaptada ao português contemporâneo, preserva a genialidade do texto original, mas oferece uma leitura mais fluida e acessível ao público atual. É ideal para estudantes, pesquisadores e amantes da literatura que desejam compreender por que Memórias Póstumas de Brás Cubas permanece tão viva, inquietante e moderna mais de um século após sua publicação. Mais do que uma narrativa sobre a morte, este livro é uma celebração da vida e de suas contradições — um retrato atemporal do ser humano, com suas fraquezas, desejos e ilusões. Ler Memórias Póstumas de Brás Cubas é mergulhar na alma de um autor que soube rir da própria condição humana com elegância e lucidez. Adquira agora a edição digital de Memórias Póstumas de Brás Cubas e descubra a genialidade que fez de Machado de Assis o maior escritor brasileiro de todos os tempos.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9790652916941"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":326,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"preview-1.0.0","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=0s-MEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=0s-MEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=0s-MEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=4&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=0s-MEQAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=0s-MEQAAQBAJ"}'),
('o7b4DwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"7 melhores contos - Machado de Assis","authors":["Machado de Assis","August Nemo"],"publisher":"Tacet Books","publishedDate":"2020-04-23","description":"Um olhar implacável e fascinante sobre a essência humana. Ler os contos machadianos é aceitar um convite para enxergar além das certezas cotidianas. Com fina sátira e observação cirúrgica, o autor expõe os dilemas morais da vida social em histórias marcadas por humor sutil e tensão psicológica. Esta antologia apresenta sete obras-primas indispensáveis e traz a íntegra de O Alienista, proporcionando uma experiência envolvente para novos leitores e admiradores que buscam revisitar páginas fundamentais. Este livro contém: Missa do Galo: Na noite de Natal, uma conversa íntima desperta uma tensão silenciosa entre um jovem e uma mulher casada. Adão e Eva Durante um jantar, um juiz propõe uma versão espirituosa da criação bíblica, sugerindo que o mundo foi na verdade obra do Diabo. O Espelho Isolado em um sítio deserto, um jovem alferes descobre que sua própria imagem depende do olhar alheio para existir. A Igreja do Diabo: Cansado da desordem do pecado, o Diabo funda a sua própria religião, mas se depara com a incoerência dos seres humanos. A Cartomante: Envolvido em um triângulo amoroso clandestino, um rapaz cético recorre às previsões misteriosas das cartas. Teoria do Medalhão: Em uma conversa franca na noite da maioridade, um pai ensina ao filho como triunfar na sociedade sem cultivar ideias próprias. A Carteira: Pressionado por dívidas, um advogado acha uma carteira cheia de dinheiro e enfrenta um dilema moral com dono conhecido. O Alienista: Empenhado em mapear os limites da razão, o Dr. Simão Bacamarte interna grande parte da vila de Itaguaí em seu hospício particular. Esta edição especial oferece ainda um conteúdo de poesias e notas de rodapé que revelam o contexto histórico, linguístico e cultural por trás das obras.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9783967990218"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"3967990214"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":259,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"0.3.3.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=o7b4DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=o7b4DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=o7b4DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=5&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=o7b4DwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=o7b4DwAAQBAJ"}'),
('M1RVDwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"MACHADO DE ASSIS: Os melhores contos","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"LeBooks Editora ","publishedDate":"2018-04-11","description":"Machado de Assis (1839-1908) é considerado um dos maiores, senão o maior escritor brasileiro de todos os tempos. Autor de \"Dom Casmurro\", \"Memórias Póstumas de Braz Cubas\", \"Quincas Borba\" e dezenas de outros títulos inesquecíveis, Machado foi um autor completo, tendo escrito romances, contos, poesias, peças de teatro, críticas, crônicas e correspondências. No gênero conto Machado publicou mais de duzentas histórias, sempre com o enorme talento que lhe é peculiar, o que torna qualquer seleção de seus melhores contos uma difícil tarefa; mas que foi realizada!. Os Melhores Contos de Machado de Assis traz ao leitor uma primorosa seleção de seus melhores contos, reconhecendo em cada um deles o talento inigualável deste genial escritor brasileiro.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9788583862116"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"8583862117"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":333,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"1.12.15.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=M1RVDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=M1RVDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=M1RVDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=6&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=M1RVDwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=M1RVDwAAQBAJ"}'),
('P30PEQAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Páginas Recolhidas","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"BoD - Books on Demand","publishedDate":"2024-06-19","description":"\"Páginas Recolhidas\" é uma coletânea de contos e crônicas do renomado escritor brasileiro Joaquim Maria Machado de Assis, publicada em 1899. Machado de Assis, um dos maiores nomes da literatura brasileira, é conhecido por sua prosa sofisticada, marcada pela ironia, análise psicológica profunda e crítica social. \"Páginas Recolhidas\" reúne uma série de textos que haviam sido publicados anteriormente em jornais e revistas, oferecendo ao leitor uma amostra diversificada do talento de Machado de Assis como contista e cronista. A coletânea inclui contos, crônicas e ensaios breves, abordando uma variedade de temas que vão desde o cotidiano da vida urbana no Rio de Janeiro até reflexões filosóficas e sociais.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9791043107719"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":56,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.1.2.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=P30PEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=P30PEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=P30PEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=7&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=P30PEQAAQBAJ&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/P%C3%A1ginas_Recolhidas.html?hl=&id=P30PEQAAQBAJ"}'),
('Y70sEAAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Machado de Assis Obra Completa Volume II","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Global Editora e Distribuidora Ltda","publishedDate":"2021-10-31","description":"Machado de Assis é o maior escritor da literatura brasileira. De infância pobre no Morro do Livramento, no Rio, foi aprendiz de tipógrafo, revisor, tradutor e escritor em todos os gêneros literários e fundador da Academia Brasileira de Letras, da qual foi seu primeiro presidente. Muitos estudiosos internacionais consideram Machado de Assis, fora da Europa, o maior escritor do século XIX. A Obra completa de Machado de Assis contempla: No Volume 1 – Uma fortuna crítica, organizada pelo professor Samuel Titan Jr., com textos de críticos escritos antes e depois da morte de Machado de Assis. No Volume 2 – Todos os livros de contos publicados pelo autor em vida, além da primeira parte de seus contos avulsos. No Volume 3 – A segunda parte dos contos avulsos e a produção de Machado nos gêneros Poesia, Teatro, Miscelânea e Correspondência. No Volume 4 – Todas as crônicas de autoria incontestável, publicadas em livros, jornais e revistas. Conheça Machado de Assis no Link https://youtu.be/1VTw6jmELoI","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9786589645078"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"6589645078"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":5242,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"1.4.4.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Y70sEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Y70sEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=Y70sEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=8&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=Y70sEAAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=Y70sEAAAQBAJ"}'),
('y140EQAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Histórias da meia-noite","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Todavia","publishedDate":"2025-03-10","description":"É o nono livro de Machado de Assis e sua segunda coletânea de contos. São seis histórias, todas veiculadas anteriormente na imprensa, que giram em torno de intrigas amorosas perturbadas pelo ciúme e pelos fantasmas da traição. De forma sutil, elas sugerem que personagens bem-nascidas, e que se julgam predestinadas à medicina, às letras, à política e ao comércio, podem alimentar tamanhas ilusões porque há por toda parte escravizados, na figura de mucamas e moleques, que volta e meia atravessam a cena.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9786556926605"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"6556926604"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":197,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.1.1.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=y140EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=y140EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=y140EQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=9&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=y140EQAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=y140EQAAQBAJ"}'),
('oT5xDwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"A mão e a luva - Edição de Bolso","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Editora Vozes Limitada","publishedDate":"2018-10-04","description":"A mão e a luva é o segundo romance de Machado de Assis, publicado em 1874, por E. Gomes de Oliveira, antigo livreiro da capital do Império. Foi inicialmente publicado em forma de folhetim, como era muito comum naquela época, saindo semanalmente no rodapé do jornal O Globo, de Quintino Bocaiuva. Neste folhetim, teve o subtítulo \"Um perfil de mulher\", o que muito bem justificava seu enredo, marcado pelos dramas amorosos da personagem Guiomar às voltas com seus três pretendentes românticos - Jorge (calculista), Estêvão (sentimental) e Luís Alves (ambicioso).","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9788532659712"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"8532659713"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":161,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"0.4.4.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=oT5xDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=oT5xDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=oT5xDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=10&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=oT5xDwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=oT5xDwAAQBAJ"}'),
('MLjmEAAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Quincas Borba","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Viseu","publishedDate":"2023-12-01","description":"Rubião é um homem simples e de bom coração que, após a morte de seu amigo Quincas Borba, herda toda a sua fortuna. Na tentativa de encontrar um novo propósito para a sua vida, ele se muda para o Rio de Janeiro, onde é seduzido pelo estilo de vida luxuoso e se envolve com pessoas que só querem se aproveitar de sua riqueza. \"Quincas Borba\" é uma obra-prima de Machado de Assis que explora a loucura, a ambição e a decadência humana. Uma leitura envolvente e cheia de reviravoltas, que faz uma crítica sutil, mas impactante, à sociedade brasileira do século XIX.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9786525461465"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"6525461464"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":426,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"0.2.2.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=MLjmEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=MLjmEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=MLjmEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=13&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=MLjmEAAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=MLjmEAAAQBAJ"}'),
('n_g_DQAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Machado de Assis - Contos Selecionados","authors":["Joaquim Maria Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Clock-Book","publishedDate":"2016-10-13","description":"Por meio dessas histórias, Machado de Assis nos faz viajar no tempo, pela linguagem, pela descrição dos costumes do século XIX. Além disso, nos faz refletir sobre o nosso presente, sobre a sociedade e os homens e seus costumes atuais. Suas histórias servem não só para passar o tempo do leitor, como sugere em seus prefácios. Os contos que escreveu fazem dele um Mestre no gênero, e de nós, leitores ávidos, curiosos e encantados, diante do modo machadiano de contar sem revelar tudo.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9788592525118"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"859252511X"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":71,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"1.2.2.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=n_g_DQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=n_g_DQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=n_g_DQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=14&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=n_g_DQAAQBAJ&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Machado_de_Assis_Contos_Selecionados.html?hl=&id=n_g_DQAAQBAJ"}'),
('50vSEAAAQBAJ', '{"title":"O contrato e O destinado","subtitle":"dois contos de Machado de Assis","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Pop Stories","publishedDate":"2023-01-17","description":"No conto \"O contrato\", o enredo gira em torno de duas jovens muito amigas, Josefa e Laura, que, ainda adolescentes, fazem um acordo de que ambas se casariam no mesmo dia e na mesma igreja. Será que conseguem? Já em \"O destinado\", a elegante Delfina, amante da dança, fica indecisa entre dois amores. Com que ficará? Com o bacharel Soares? Com o bacharel Antunes?","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9786554114011"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"6554114017"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":23,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.2.3.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=50vSEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=50vSEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=50vSEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=15&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=50vSEAAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=50vSEAAAQBAJ"}'),
('_YvyEAAAQBAJ', '{"title":"O que são as moças","authors":["Machado de Assis"],"publisher":"Pop Stories","publishedDate":"2023-10-03","description":"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Fusce et sapien iaculis arcu efficitur viverra eu eget ante. Pellentesque sodales ligula eget accumsan consequat. Donec dolor est, consequat nec quam id, ornare imperdiet tortor. Curabitur vehicula efficitur enim nec ornare. Ut eu pellentesque sapien, vitae vehicula magna. Praesent scelerisque tortor at nibh imperdiet bibendum. Nullam facilisis turpis aliquam diam pulvinar facilisis. Duis dictum enim non ligula laoreet, ac ornare lorem imperdiet. Maecenas vel placerat orci, eu suscipit lectus. Nulla ultrices placerat augue ac gravida. Vivamus nulla sem, pulvinar a molestie eget, vulputate et ligula.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9786554115551"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"6554115552"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":33,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Fiction"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.2.3.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=_YvyEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=_YvyEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=_YvyEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Machado+de+Assis&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=16&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=_YvyEAAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=_YvyEAAAQBAJ"}'),
('jh3OAAAAMAAJ', '{"title":"Technology Reports","authors":["Tōhoku Daigaku"],"publishedDate":"1930","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"OTHER","identifier":"UOM:39015073204847"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":false},"pageCount":756,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.5.5.0.preview.0","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=jh3OAAAAMAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=jh3OAAAAMAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=jh3OAAAAMAAJ&q=technology&dq=technology&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=8&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=jh3OAAAAMAAJ&dq=technology&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Technology_Reports.html?hl=&id=jh3OAAAAMAAJ"}'),
('9gtJAAAAMAAJ', '{"title":"Technology","authors":["Manchester (Greater Manchester). College of Science and Technology"],"publishedDate":"1912","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"OTHER","identifier":"UOM:39015067236144"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":false},"pageCount":898,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.12.13.0.preview.0","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=9gtJAAAAMAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=9gtJAAAAMAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=9gtJAAAAMAAJ&q=technology&dq=technology&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=20&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=9gtJAAAAMAAJ&dq=technology&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Technology.html?hl=&id=9gtJAAAAMAAJ"}'),
('Qre2wgW4kZ8C', '{"title":"El Cambio tecnológico hacia el nuevo milenio","subtitle":"debates y nuevas teorías","authors":["Mikel Gómez Uranga","Miguel Sánchez Padrón","Enrique de la Puerta"],"publisher":"Icaria Editorial","publishedDate":"1992","description":"Esta es una obra colectiva que, desde una perspectiva rigurosa, aborda un tema apasionante y actual como es el de la economía del cambio tecnológico. Escriben: Jean Marc Bidaux, Mario Cimoli, Enrique De La Puerta, Giovanni Dosi, Dominique Foray, Mikel Gómez Uranda, entre otros.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"8474261902"},{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9788474261905"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":424,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"averageRating":4.5,"ratingsCount":2,"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.11.7.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Qre2wgW4kZ8C&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Qre2wgW4kZ8C&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"es","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=Qre2wgW4kZ8C&pg=PA398&dq=tecnologia&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=2&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=Qre2wgW4kZ8C&dq=tecnologia&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/El_Cambio_tecnol%C3%B3gico_hacia_el_nuevo_mi.html?hl=&id=Qre2wgW4kZ8C"}'),
('2IfgV3MQRLkC', '{"title":"Tissue Engineering","subtitle":"Fundamentals and Applications","authors":["Yoshito Ikada"],"publisher":"Elsevier","publishedDate":"2011-08-29","description":"Tissue engineering is an emerging interdisciplinary field, occupying a major position in the regenerative medicine that aims at restoring lost or damaged tissues and organs with use of cells. Regenerative medicine includes cellular therapy and tissue engineering. In general, the former treats patients by cell infusion alone, while tissue engineering needs biomaterials and growth factors in addition to cells. Biomaterials function in tissue engineering as the scaffold or template for cells to proliferate, differentiate, and produce matrices. Tissue Engineering focuses on the fundamentals (biomaterials, scaffolds, cell cultures, bioreactors, animal models etc.), recent animal and human trials, and future prospects regarding tissue engineering. Almost twenty years have passed since the advent of the tissue engineering, whicht uses cells, scaffolds, and growth factors for regeneration of neotissues. The number of investigations on tissue engineering is still increasing tremendously. Nevertheless, it seems likely that the number of reports describing clinical trials of tissue engineering will remain very limited. Even the studies that apply tissue engineering research to large animals have not been performed yet on a large scale. The major objective of this book is to address this question from a science and technology point of view, and to describe the principles of basic technologies that have currently been developed by numerous research groups. - Helps reader understand the key issues required for promotion of clinical trials in tissue engineering - Covers in full the issues related to tissue engineering - Looking at current technologies in the field","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9780080464008"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"0080464009"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":491,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"2.5.1.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=2IfgV3MQRLkC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=2IfgV3MQRLkC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=2IfgV3MQRLkC&pg=PA423&dq=engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=1&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=2IfgV3MQRLkC&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=2IfgV3MQRLkC"}'),
('1DjXr7JefGAC', '{"title":"Successful Implementation of Concurrent Engineering Products and Processes","authors":["Sammy G. Shina"],"publisher":"John Wiley & Sons","publishedDate":"1993-12-16","description":"This working guide shows how to put concurrent engineering principles into action, using actual case examples from large and small companies. The case study approach is augmented with detailed advice and techniques for measuring and analyzing product and process development data. A must-have reference for every designer and firm that plans or contemplates this efficient and profitable method.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"0471285102"},{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9780471285106"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":296,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.7.7.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=1DjXr7JefGAC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=1DjXr7JefGAC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=1DjXr7JefGAC&pg=PA114&dq=engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=2&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=1DjXr7JefGAC&dq=engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Successful_Implementation_of_Concurrent.html?hl=&id=1DjXr7JefGAC"}'),
('rQa4DwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Advanced Engineering Forum Vol. 20","authors":["Dumitru Nedelcu"],"publisher":"Trans Tech Publications Ltd","publishedDate":"2017-01-20","description":"Meet the 20th volume of the journal \"Advanced Engineering Forum\". The volume contains the manuscripts describing the results of engineering solutions and research dealing with actual problems in the study of structural materials and their processing technologies, engineering research in geotechnics and mining construction, environmental engineering and production management. Published articles will be useful for professionals in the field of mechanical engineering and for students and academic staff concerned with the related specialties.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9783035732054"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"3035732051"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":95,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.1.2.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=rQa4DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=rQa4DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=rQa4DwAAQBAJ&pg=PA10&dq=engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=7&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=rQa4DwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=rQa4DwAAQBAJ"}'),
('qP7HvuakLgEC', '{"title":"The Electrical Engineering Handbook,Second Edition","authors":["Richard C. Dorf"],"publisher":"CRC Press","publishedDate":"1997-09-26","description":"In 1993, the first edition of The Electrical Engineering Handbook set a new standard for breadth and depth of coverage in an engineering reference work. Now, this classic has been substantially revised and updated to include the latest information on all the important topics in electrical engineering today. Every electrical engineer should have an opportunity to expand his expertise with this definitive guide. In a single volume, this handbook provides a complete reference to answer the questions encountered by practicing engineers in industry, government, or academia. This well-organized book is divided into 12 major sections that encompass the entire field of electrical engineering, including circuits, signal processing, electronics, electromagnetics, electrical effects and devices, and energy, and the emerging trends in the fields of communications, digital devices, computer engineering, systems, and biomedical engineering. A compendium of physical, chemical, material, and mathematical data completes this comprehensive resource. Every major topic is thoroughly covered and every important concept is defined, described, and illustrated. Conceptually challenging but carefully explained articles are equally valuable to the practicing engineer, researchers, and students. A distinguished advisory board and contributors including many of the leading authors, professors, and researchers in the field today assist noted author and professor Richard Dorf in offering complete coverage of this rapidly expanding field. No other single volume available today offers this combination of broad coverage and depth of exploration of the topics. The Electrical Engineering Handbook will be an invaluable resource for electrical engineers for years to come.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"1420049763"},{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9781420049763"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":2758,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"averageRating":4.5,"ratingsCount":6,"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.9.5.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=qP7HvuakLgEC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=qP7HvuakLgEC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=qP7HvuakLgEC&printsec=frontcover&dq=electrical+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=2&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=qP7HvuakLgEC&dq=electrical+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Electrical_Engineering_Handbook_Seco.html?hl=&id=qP7HvuakLgEC"}'),
('N9z8BAAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Electrical Engineer''s Reference Book","authors":["M A Laughton","M G Say"],"publisher":"Elsevier","publishedDate":"2013-10-22","description":"Electrical Engineer''s Reference Book, Fourteenth Edition focuses on electrical engineering. The book first discusses units, mathematics, and physical quantities, including the international unit system, physical properties, and electricity. The text also looks at network and control systems analysis. The book examines materials used in electrical engineering. Topics include conducting materials, superconductors, silicon, insulating materials, electrical steels, and soft irons and relay steels. The text underscores electrical metrology and instrumentation, steam-generating plants, turbines and diesel plants, and nuclear reactor plants. The book also discusses alternative energy sources. Concerns include wind, geothermal, wave, ocean thermal, solar, and tidal energy. The text then looks at alternating-current generators. Stator windings, insulation, output equation, armature reaction, and reactants and time-constraints are described. The book also examines overhead lines, cables, power transformers, switchgears and protection, supply and control of reactive power, and power systems operation and control. The text is a vital source of reference for readers interested in electrical engineering.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9781483102634"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"1483102637"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":993,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.3.2.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=N9z8BAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=N9z8BAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=N9z8BAAAQBAJ&pg=SA35-PA4&dq=electrical+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=3&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=N9z8BAAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=N9z8BAAAQBAJ"}'),
('rOg6B38bunIC', '{"title":"Perspectives in Civil Engineering","subtitle":"Commemorating the 150th Anniversary of the American Society of Civil Engineers","authors":["Jeffrey S. Russell"],"publisher":"ASCE Publications","publishedDate":"2003-01-01","description":"This report contains 27 papers that serve as a testament to the state-of-the-art of civil engineering at the outset of the 21st century, as well as to commemorate the ASCE''s Sesquicentennial. Written by the leading practitioners, educators, and researchers of civil engineering, each of these peer-reviewed papers explores a particular aspect of civil engineering knowledge and practice. Each paper explores the development of a particular civil engineering specialty, including milestones and future barriers, constraints, and opportunities. The papers celebrate the history, heritage, and accomplishments of the profession in all facets of practice, including construction facilities, special structures, engineering mechanics, surveying and mapping, irrigation and water quality, forensics, computing, materials, geotechnical engineering, hydraulic engineering, and transportation engineering. While each paper is unique, collectively they provide a snapshot of the profession while offering thoughtful predictions of likely developments in the years to come. Together the papers illuminate the mounting complexity facing civil engineering stemming from rapid growth in scientific knowledge, technological development, and human populations, especially in the last 50 years. An overarching theme is the need for systems-level approaches and consideration from undergraduate education through advanced engineering materials, processes, technologies, and design methods and tools. These papers speak to the need for civil engineers of all specialties to recognize and embrace the growing interconnectedness of the global infrastructure, economy, society, and the need to work for more sustainable, life-cycle-oriented solutions. While embracing the past and the present, the papers collected here clearly have an eye on the future needs of ASCE and the civil engineering profession.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"0784475385"},{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9780784475386"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":422,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"averageRating":5,"ratingsCount":1,"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"1.4.6.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=rOg6B38bunIC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=rOg6B38bunIC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=rOg6B38bunIC&pg=PA226&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=1&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=rOg6B38bunIC&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Perspectives_in_Civil_Engineering.html?hl=&id=rOg6B38bunIC"}'),
('miIvEAAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Practical Civil Engineering","authors":["P.K. Jayasree","K Balan","V Rani"],"publisher":"CRC Press","publishedDate":"2021-05-03","description":"The book provides primary information about civil engineering to both a civil and non-civil engineering audience in areas such as construction management, estate management, and building. Basic civil engineering topics like surveying, building materials, construction technology and management, concrete technology, steel structures, soil mechanics and foundations, water resources, transportation and environment engineering are explained in detail. Codal provisions of US, UK and India are included to cater to a global audience. Insights into techniques like modern surveying equipment and technologies, sustainable construction materials, and modern construction materials are also included. Key features: • Provides a concise presentation of theory and practice for all technical in civil engineering. • Contains detailed theory with lucid illustrations. • Focuses on the management aspects of a civil engineer''s job. • Addresses contemporary issues such as permitting, globalization, sustainability, and emerging technologies. • Includes codal provisions of US, UK and India. The book is aimed at professionals and senior undergraduate students in civil engineering, non-specialist civil engineering audience","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9781138033146"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"1138033146"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":677,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.2.2.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=miIvEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=miIvEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=miIvEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=9&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=miIvEAAAQBAJ&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Practical_Civil_Engineering.html?hl=&id=miIvEAAAQBAJ"}'),
('8CkwBWsi_vsC', '{"title":"Fundamentals of Infrastructure Engineering","subtitle":"Civil Engineering Systems, Second Edition,","authors":["Patrick H. McDonald"],"publisher":"CRC Press","publishedDate":"2001-08-31","description":"Based on the author''s extensive experience, this book presents recent advances in systems theory and methodology for infrastructure engineering. It highlights modern approaches to the analysis, design, construction, implementation, management, and maintenance of large-scale infrastructure systems and projects, including transportation and water resources. This thoroughly updated and expanded second edition covers contemporary state-space methods for systems modeling and design, user-friendly interactive programs for outcomes research, advanced techniques for control of water supply systems and pipe networks, and Eigenvalue, hydraulic, and discount rate computations.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"0824706129"},{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9780824706128"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":552,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.6.4.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=8CkwBWsi_vsC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=8CkwBWsi_vsC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=8CkwBWsi_vsC&printsec=frontcover&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=12&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=8CkwBWsi_vsC&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Fundamentals_of_Infrastructure_Engineeri.html?hl=&id=8CkwBWsi_vsC"}'),
('izBsswEACAAJ', '{"title":"Civil Engineering as Applied in Construction","authors":["Leveson Francis Vernon-Harcourt"],"publisher":"Forgotten Books","publishedDate":"2015-06-26","description":"Excerpt from Civil Engineering as Applied in Construction Civil engineering, even in its more restricted signification as applied to works of construction, covers such a wide range that it might reasonably appear somewhat presumptuous for any civil engineer to endeavour to deal with so far-reaching a subject, more especially within the limits of a single volume; and my sole excuse for making the attempt is that nearly ten years ago I unexpectedly received a request from Messrs. Longmans to undertake this onerous task. Possibly the publication of \"Achievements in Engineering\" in 1891, may have led to the request being addressed to me; but that book, giving descriptions, in a popular form, of some of the most notable engineering works, and only touching incidentally upon the principles involved in their construction for the sake of engineering students, was totally different in scope to this book, which treats primarily of the principles involved in the various branches of engineering construction, and refers to a great variety of works chiefly with the view of illustrating the methods by which these principles receive their practical application. Descriptions of a few important engineering works, in popular language, are comparatively easy of accomplishment; and the facility with which the earlier book was carried out, led me to underrate the difficulties and labour inseparable from the aims of the present book, which, had I appreciated them at the time, would probably have decided me to decline the proposal. Moreover, the leisure at my disposal proved much less than I had anticipated; and, owing to the various professional demands on my time, the preparation of the book has, to my regret, been greatly delayed, so that at times I almost despaired of bringing it to a conclusion; and it was only the courteous consideration accorded me by Messrs. Longmans, and their strongly expressed wish that I should not relinquish the undertaking, that have at last led to the completion of the book according to the scheme originally laid down by me. About the Publisher Forgotten Books publishes hundreds of thousands of rare and classic books. Find more at www.forgottenbooks.com This book is a reproduction of an important historical work. Forgotten Books uses state-of-the-art technology to digitally reconstruct the work, preserving the original format whilst repairing imperfections present in the aged copy. In rare cases, an imperfection in the original, such as a blemish or missing page, may be replicated in our edition. We do, however, repair the vast majority of imperfections successfully; any imperfections that remain are intentionally left to preserve the state of such historical works.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"1330199928"},{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9781330199923"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":false},"pageCount":687,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"preview-1.0.0","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=izBsswEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=izBsswEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=izBsswEACAAJ&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=15&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=izBsswEACAAJ&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Civil_Engineering_as_Applied_in_Construc.html?hl=&id=izBsswEACAAJ"}'),
('uzGxDwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Dynamic of Civil Engineering and Transport Structures and Wind Engineering","authors":["Kamila Kotrasova","Jozef Melcer"],"publisher":"Trans Tech Publications Ltd","publishedDate":"2014-08-18","description":"Selected, peer reviewed papers from the 6th International Scientific Conference on Dynamic of Civil Engineering and Transport Structures and Wind Engineering (DYN-WIND 2014), May 25-29, 2014, Donovaly, Slovak Republic","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9783038265801"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"3038265802"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":325,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.2.2.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=uzGxDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=uzGxDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=uzGxDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=18&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=uzGxDwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=uzGxDwAAQBAJ"}'),
('nRb8DwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"The Observational Method in Civil Engineering","subtitle":"Minimising Risk, Maximising Economy","authors":["Alan Powderham","Anthony O''Brien"],"publisher":"CRC Press","publishedDate":"2020-09-28","description":"The Observational Method (OM) is a natural and powerful technique that maximises economy while assuring safety. Its key features are highlighted in The Observational Method in Civil Engineering through twelve case histories from major infrastructure projects. They cover protection of adjacent structures including buildings and railway systems, bored and jacked tunnels, shafts and cofferdams, retaining walls, embankments, deep foundations, ground improvement and groundwater control. They illustrate how the OM can achieve more effective collaboration between the client and the design and construction teams, as well as how it can enhance the industry’s ability to learn from experience, thus improving future practice and stimulating innovation. Despite these advantages, the OM is significantly underused. The book demonstrates how the full potential of the OM can overcome a wide range of concerns and constraints. Other chapters address the advantages and limitations of the OM, the key role of progressive modification, the art of achieving agreement and the commercial and contractual environment. The book will appeal to a range of construction professionals, including civil, structural and geotechnical engineers, contractors and owners. It will also be of interest to students and researchers.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9781000164855"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"1000164853"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":388,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.1.1.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=nRb8DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=nRb8DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=nRb8DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=civil+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=20&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=nRb8DwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=nRb8DwAAQBAJ"}'),
('aF_yEQAAQBAJ', '{"title":"THE COMPLETE HANDBOOK OF MECHANICAL ENGINEERING","subtitle":"Fundamentals, Mechanics, Materials, Thermal & Fluid Systems, Machine Design, and Manufacturing","authors":["MICHAEL DURAN"],"publisher":"Frenz LLC","publishedDate":"2026-07-07T00:00:00Z","description":"The Complete Handbook of Mechanical Engineering is a comprehensive, single-volume reference designed to deliver clear, practical coverage of the topics every mechanical engineer, engineering student, and technical professional needs to know. Organized into 9 parts and 41 chapters — plus quick-reference appendices covering essential formulas,...","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9798259607583"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":107,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"1.4.4.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=aF_yEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=aF_yEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=aF_yEQAAQBAJ&pg=PA12&dq=mechanical+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=1&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=aF_yEQAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=aF_yEQAAQBAJ"}'),
('EPR6CgAAQBAJ', '{"title":"FUNDAMENTALS OF MECHANICAL ENGINEERING: THERMODYNAMICS, MECHANICS, THEORY OF MACHINES, STRENGTH OF MATERIALS AND FLUID DYNAMICS, THIRD EDITION","authors":["SAWHNEY, G. S."],"publisher":"PHI Learning Pvt. Ltd.","publishedDate":"2015-06-30","description":"Written with the first year engineering students of undergraduate level in mind, the well-designed textbook, now in its Third Edition, explains the fundamentals of mechanical engineering in the area of thermodynamics, mechanics, theory of machines, strength of materials and fluid dynamics. As these subjects form a basic part of an engineer’s education, this text is admirably suited to meet the needs of the common course in mechanical engineering prescribed in the curricula of almost all branches of engineering. This revised edition includes a new chapter on ‘Fluid Dynamics’ to meet the course requirement. Key Features • Presents an introduction to basic mechanical engineering topics required by all engineering students in their studies. • Includes a series of objective type question (True and False, Fill in the Blanks and Multiple Choice Questions) with explanatory answers to help students in preparing for competitive examinations. • Provides a large number of solved problems culled from the latest university and competitive examination papers which help in understanding theory.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9788120351332"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"8120351339"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":951,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"0.2.1.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=EPR6CgAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=EPR6CgAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=EPR6CgAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=mechanical+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=14&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=EPR6CgAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=EPR6CgAAQBAJ"}'),
('Nb0tAAAACAAJ', '{"title":"Technology: Engineering & Design, Student Edition","authors":["McGraw-Hill Education"],"publisher":"McGraw-Hill Education","publishedDate":"2007-03-06","description":"Technology: Engineering & Design is helping today''s students develop the technology of tomorrow!","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"0078768098"},{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9780078768095"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":false},"pageCount":0,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"preview-1.0.0","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Nb0tAAAACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=Nb0tAAAACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=Nb0tAAAACAAJ&dq=technology+and+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=5&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=Nb0tAAAACAAJ&dq=technology+and+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Technology_Engineering_Design_Student_Ed.html?hl=&id=Nb0tAAAACAAJ"}'),
('qtKyDwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Manufacturing Automation Technology Development","authors":["Bo Zhao","Guang Lin Wang","Wei Ma","Zhibo Yang","Yan Yan Yan"],"publisher":"Trans Tech Publications Ltd","publishedDate":"2010-12-30","description":"Selected, peer reviewed papers from the 14th Conference of China University Society on Manufacturing Automation, August 11-14, 2010, Jiaozuo, China","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9783038134855"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"3038134856"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":true},"pageCount":723,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.2.2.0.preview.1","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=qtKyDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=qtKyDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=qtKyDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA71&dq=technology+and+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=10&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=qtKyDwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=qtKyDwAAQBAJ"}'),
('17J30AEACAAJ', '{"title":"Foundations of Engineering and Technology","authors":["Scott Bartholomew","Greg J Strimel","Michael E Grubbs","R Thomas Wright"],"publishedDate":"2023-11-20","description":"Organized to follow the textbook on a chapter-by-chapter basis, providing questions to help the student review the material presented in the chapter. This supplement is a consumable resource, designed with perforated pages so that a given chapter can be removed and turned in for grading or checking.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9798891181571"}],"readingModes":{"text":false,"image":false},"pageCount":0,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"preview-1.0.0","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=17J30AEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=17J30AEACAAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=17J30AEACAAJ&dq=technology+and+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=13&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=17J30AEACAAJ&dq=technology+and+engineering&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/Foundations_of_Engineering_and_Technolog.html?hl=&id=17J30AEACAAJ"}'),
('NaUq-Qkm-fMC', '{"title":"International Asia Conference on Industrial Engineering and Management Innovation (IEMI2012) Proceedings","subtitle":"Core Areas of Industrial Engineering","authors":["Ershi Qi","Jiang Shen","Runliang Dou"],"publisher":"Springer Science & Business Media","publishedDate":"2013-05-29","description":"The International Conference on Industrial Engineering and Engineering Management is sponsored by the Chinese Industrial Engineering Institution, CMES, which is the only national-level academic society for Industrial Engineering. The conference is held annually as the major event in this arena. Being the largest and the most authoritative international academic conference held in China, it provides an academic platform for experts and entrepreneurs in the areas of international industrial engineering and management to exchange their research findings. Many experts in various fields from China and around the world gather together at the conference to review, exchange, summarize and promote their achievements in the fields of industrial engineering and engineering management. For example, some experts pay special attention to the current state of the application of related techniques in China as well as their future prospects, such as green product design, quality control and management, supply chain and logistics management to address the need for, amongst other things low-carbon, energy-saving and emission-reduction. They also offer opinions on the outlook for the development of related techniques. The proceedings offers impressive methods and concrete applications for experts from colleges and universities, research institutions and enterprises who are engaged in theoretical research into industrial engineering and engineering management and its applications. As all the papers are of great value from both an academic and a practical point of view, they also provide research data for international scholars who are investigating Chinese style enterprises and engineering management.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9783642384455"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"3642384455"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":1666,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Technology & Engineering"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"0.9.7.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=NaUq-Qkm-fMC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=NaUq-Qkm-fMC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"en","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=NaUq-Qkm-fMC&pg=PA146&dq=industrial+technology&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=2&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=NaUq-Qkm-fMC&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=NaUq-Qkm-fMC"}'),
('ebMc469Ai68C', '{"title":"A Cabeça de Steve Jobs","subtitle":"As lições do líder da empresa mais revolucionária do mundo","authors":["Leander Kahney"],"publisher":"Agir","publishedDate":"2011-10-27","description":"É difícil acreditar que um único homem tenha revolucionado a informática nos anos 1970 e 1980 (com o Apple II e o Mac), o cinema de animação nos anos 1990 (com a Pixar) e, mais recentemente, a música digital (com o iPod e o iTunes). Foi o que fez Steve Jobs, cofundador e presidente da Apple. Não é à toa que conquistou milhões de fãs ardorosos no mundo inteiro.A cabeça de Steve Jobs reúne as lições empresariais desse inovador visionário e revela os segredos de seu sucesso. Considerado um líder notável nas indústrias da tecnologia de informação e do entretenimento, Jobs é também dono de um temperamento difícil: seus épicos acessos de raiva já se tornaram lenda. O jornalista e escritor Leander Kahney, que há anos acompanha de perto a carreira do empresário, nos mostra aqui o homem por trás da figura cultuada: um fascinante poço de contradições.Jobs é um elitista que considera a maioria das pessoas imbecil, mas faz gadgets fáceis de serem utilizados por qualquer idiota. É obsessivo e tem pavio curto, mas constrói parcerias sólidas e duradouras com gênios criativos como Steve Wozniak, Jonathan Ive e John Lasseter. É budista e antimaterialista, mas faz produtos para mercados de massa em fábricas asiáticas e os promove com domínio absoluto da linguagem da propaganda. Em suma, Jobs adotou os traços considerados por alguns como defeitos - narcisismo, perfeccionismo, desejo de controle total - para conduzir a Apple e a Pixar ao triunfo contra probabilidades adversas.Com texto ágil, Leander Kahney identifica os princípios que norteiam Jobs ao lançar produtos irresistíveis, ao atrair compradores fanaticamente fiéis e ao administrar algumas das marcas mais poderosas do mundo.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9788522013555"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"8522013551"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":282,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Biography & Autobiography"],"averageRating":5,"ratingsCount":1,"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"2.11.11.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=ebMc469Ai68C&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=ebMc469Ai68C&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=ebMc469Ai68C&printsec=frontcover&dq=Steve+Jobs&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=1&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=ebMc469Ai68C&dq=Steve+Jobs&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://books.google.com/books/about/A_Cabe%C3%A7a_de_Steve_Jobs.html?hl=&id=ebMc469Ai68C"}'),
('LbuZEAAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Steve Jobs","authors":["Walter Isaacson"],"publisher":"Editora Intrinseca","publishedDate":"2022-12-02","description":"Biografia do brilhante e controverso cofundador da Apple, pelo badalado autor de Leonardo da Vinci, é relançada em nova edição Baseando-se em mais de quarenta entrevistas realizadas com Steve Jobs ao longo de dois anos — e em várias outras feitas com mais de cem familiares, amigos, adversários, concorrentes e colegas de trabalho —, Walter Isaacson apresenta nesta biografia a fascinante trajetória de um ícone. Intenso, de personalidade forte e apaixonado por perfeição, Jobs viveu altos e baixos e revolucionou seis indústrias: a de computadores pessoais, a de filmes de animação, a da música, a da telefonia celular, a da computação em tablet e a da publicação digital. Não à toa, cerca de dez anos após sua morte ele continua sendo o representante máximo da inventividade e da imaginação aplicada. Embora tenha cooperado com o autor de sua biografia, Jobs não tentou controlar o conteúdo destas páginas — deu apenas alguns pitacos na capa, segundo Isaacson. Não houve assunto proibido. O empresário, inclusive, incentivou aqueles que conhecia a falarem sobre ele com sinceridade. E ele, por sua vez, foi franco, muitas vezes brutal, ao mencionar as pessoas com quem trabalhou e os concorrentes. Assim, seus amigos, colegas e inimigos oferecem uma visão nua e crua das paixões, do perfeccionismo, das obsessões, do talento artístico, das crueldades e da compulsão por controle que moldaram o jeito de Jobs de fazer negócios e os produtos inovadores que criou. A história de vida de Steve Jobs, como nos mostra este livro que o revela em essência, ensina diversas lições sobre inovação, caráter, prudência, liderança e valores.","industryIdentifiers":[{"type":"ISBN_13","identifier":"9786555603330"},{"type":"ISBN_10","identifier":"655560333X"}],"readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":734,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Biography & Autobiography"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":true,"contentVersion":"1.13.15.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=LbuZEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=LbuZEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=LbuZEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=Steve+Jobs&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=3&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=LbuZEAAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=LbuZEAAAQBAJ"}'),
('rONmDwAAQBAJ', '{"title":"Guia Grandes Visionários","subtitle":"Steve Jobs","authors":["Guia Grandes Visionários","Curiosidades","Técnologia","On Line Editora"],"publisher":"On Line Editora","description":"Steve Jobs foi criado por uma família adotiva. Mas esse é apenas um dos ingredientes que tornam sua história tão atraente a ponto de já ter rendido grandes produções da indústria cinematográfica norte-americana. Sua personalidade forte combinada a uma alma que buscou desde cedo a iluminação no zen budismo, o ímpeto empreendedor, a usina de ideias que era sua cabeça e a obsessão com que perseguia e fazia suas equipes perseguirem a perfeição nos produtos da Apple fizeram dele uma referência no universo da inovação tecnológica.","readingModes":{"text":true,"image":true},"pageCount":65,"printType":"BOOK","categories":["Biography & Autobiography"],"maturityRating":"NOT_MATURE","allowAnonLogging":false,"contentVersion":"1.2.2.0.preview.3","panelizationSummary":{"containsEpubBubbles":false,"containsImageBubbles":false},"imageLinks":{"smallThumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=rONmDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api","thumbnail":"http://books.google.com/books/content?id=rONmDwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"},"language":"pt-BR","previewLink":"http://books.google.com.br/books?id=rONmDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA66&dq=Steve+Jobs&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=7&source=gbs_api","infoLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=rONmDwAAQBAJ&source=gbs_api","canonicalVolumeLink":"https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=rONmDwAAQBAJ"}'),
